### Third-Party Licenses & Compliance

This tool interacts with and depends on the following open source software:

- **textual**: MIT License (<https://github.com/Textualize/textual>) - Modern terminal user interface framework.
- **rich**: MIT License (<https://github.com/Textualize/rich>) - Terminal formatting, table rendering, and styled text.
- **yt-dlp**: The Unlicense (<https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp>) - Audio stream and metadata extractor.
- **requests**: Apache License 2.0 (<https://github.com/psf/requests>) - HTTP client library.
- **cava**: MIT License (<https://github.com/karlstav/cava>) - Console-based Audio Visualizer executed as a separate subprocess.
- **mpv**: GPL-2.0-or-later / LGPL-2.1-or-later (<https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv>) - Media player daemon controlled via external JSON IPC over Unix domain socket.
- **ffmpeg**: LGPL-2.1-or-later / GPL-2.0-or-later (<https://ffmpeg.org>) - Multimedia processing toolkit (optional helper for stream decoding).
